2 CONT 11. JUAN-ALONSO4 (SOSA) DE ESTRADA (JUAN-ALONSO3 DE CABRERA, LOPE2 DE SOSA, JUAN-ALONSO1 DE SOUSA) was born 03 Feb 1542 in Villa Qrquedo, Toledo, Spain. He married MARIANA DE GUEVARA-Y-DE-BARRIOS, daughter of DIEGO DE GUEVARA-Y-TO
2 CONC VAR and ISABEL DE BARRIOS-URREA-Y-SUAREZ. She was born in Mexico City, D. F., New Spain (Mexico).
