1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A granddaughter of Christopher Columbus, she married her cousin, Luis de la Cueva (died 1580), Captain of the Guard to Emperor Charles V, and brother of the Duke of Albuquerque.  Their only daughter was María Colón
2 CONC  de la Cueva (c. 1548-c.1600) who claimed the duchy of Veragua.
2 CONT
