2 CONT Notes for Baltazar Castano de Sosa: Baltasar was a founder of Saltillo, Mexico in 1577. It is believed that Baltasar was probably the brother of Gaspar Castano de Sosa, who secretly led Jewish services in the hills that surround M
2 CONC onterrey, MX. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Baltasar de Sosa, one of the founders of Saltillo whose name figures in the register of the grants made by Alberto del Canto in 1577; in 1580 he was the mayor of said town.[477] Baltasar de Sosa was married to Inés Rodríguez, Port
2 CONC uguese both of them and they were parents of Alonso Rodrígues, Diego Rodríguez and Lucas García.[478]
