2 CONT Following Notes are from Star Connection, an amazing site dedicated to the many tribes of Spaniards settling Mexico. The sites focus is South Texas.  Much Collaboration and hard work has gone into it the site.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Baltazar Castano de Sosa:  
2 CONT
2 CONT Baltasar was a founder of Saltillo, Mexico in 1577. It is believed that Baltasar was probably the brother of Gaspar Castano de Sosa, who secretly led Jewish services in the hills that surround Monterrey, Mx.
2 CONT
2 CONT Baltasar de Sosa, one of the founders of Saltillo whose name figures in the register of the grants made by Alberto del Canto in 1577; in 1580 he was the mayor of said town. Portuguese both husband and wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Name--Baltazar Castano de Sosa
2 CONT Birth--1537, Portugal
2 CONT Death--1595, Saltillo Father--de Sosa
2 CONT
2 CONT Misc. Notes New Christian of Jewish descent he was an early founder of Saltillo. He received a land grant from Alberto del Canto in 1577.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source Raul Longorias Database http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b188.html#P956
2 CONT
2 CONT Baltasar de SOSA was elected as Mayor of Saltillo in 1583 in Saltillo, Coahuila, New Spain. Baltasar de Sosa was one of the 15 settlers who came with Diego Montemayor when he founded the city of Monterrey in 1596.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Ines RODRIGUEZ. Baltasar de SOSA and Ines RODRIGUEZ were married. A census of the Villa of Cerralvo (Monterrey) conducted on September 4, 1626, noted that Lucas Garcia and his family did not have a house at that time and t
2 CONC hat they lived in the house of his brother Diego Rodriguez. Diego Rodriguez' dwelling is described as being 50 paces from and facing the Convent of San Francisco. The dwelling contained 2 rooms and "un torrecilla alta", or small t
2 CONC ower. Diego Rodriguez and his family lived in one of the rooms, his brother Lucas Garcia lived in the other room, and Diego Rodriguez' son-in-law Miguel de Montemayor lived with his family in the small tower. Children were: Capt. 
2 CONC Diego RODRIGUEZ, Maria RODRIGUEZ, Capt. Lucas GARCIA.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://gw5.geneanet.org/sanchiz?lang=en;pz=tomas;nz=sanchez+garza;ocz=0;p=alfonso;n=rodriguez
2 CONT --------------------
