1 NOTE Isabella was betrothed to Paolo Giordano Orsini when she was 11 years of age.
2 CONT She had a very open and friendly personality. She served as regent over Paolo's holdings while he was at war. When he came back he heard rumors of infidelity between Isabella and his Cousin, Troilo Orsini.
2 CONT Her husband strangled her himself, "sparing her from the executioner's hands".
