2 CONT 			 '''<nowiki>--------------------</nowiki>'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Doña Ana de Sosa married with Alferez Alonso de Farias, son of Captain Juan de Farias (vecino de Terreno y Minas de Mazapi) and Doña Maria de Treviño y Quintanilla
2 CONT
2 CONT '''<nowiki>--------------------</nowiki>'''
2 CONT
2 CONT (5)	Ana SOSA NAVARRO m. 1611, Alonso FARIAS TREVIÑO, b. 1580, (son of Juan DE-FARIAS and Maria TREVIÑO QUINTANILLA). daughter of  Alonso SOSA ALBORNOZ b. 1549, Xochitla, Mex, Mex, m. (1) abt 1565, Juana RAMIREZ ORTIZ  children:
2 CONT * (a)	Alonso FARIAS SOSA b. 1626.
2 CONT * (b)	Ana FARIAS SOSA m. Alfonso Hernando ARREDONDO AGUERO.
2 CONT * (c)	Juan FARIAS SOSA b. 1630.
2 CONT * (d)	Maria SOSA FARIAS m. Vicente SALDIVAR REZA, b. 1597, (son of Juan GUERRA REZA and Ana (Magdalena?) SALDIVAR MENDOZA).
2 CONT * (e)	Francisca SOSA m. abt 1633, Juan DE-ARREDONDO, b. abt 1583. 						 http://vsalgs.org/stnemgenealogy/alonsoes.html
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT In the book, Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza, she is listed as a descendent of the Don Alonso of Estrada. Page 85.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1598, she was with her father in New Mexico, where under the administration of Gov. Juan de Onate, her father was murdered.
2 CONT
