1 OCCU accused	 of participating in pagan games 1628 (Age 22 years) San Juan Pueblo, New Mexico, USA Note: He denied the charges., Soldier, 1632, Galisteo, New Spain
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In March 1632, Fray Pedro Sambrano, the friar at the Pueblo of Galisteo, mentioned the name of Gerónimo Pacehco (ONMF: 83), who was described as a mestizo and a soldier. (AGN, Inq, t. 304, 189v)
