2 CONT
2 CONT      Eleonora de Medici was born on 28 February 1567.  (1) She was the daughter of Francesco I de Medici, Granduca di Toscana and Joanna Erzherzogin von Österreich.1 She married Vincenzo I Gonzaga, 4th Duca di Mantova, son of Gugl
2 CONC ielmo Gonzaga, 3rd Duca di Mantova and Eleonora Erzherzogin von Österreich, on 29 April 1584. (1) She died on 19 September 1611 at age 44 at Cavriana. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Eleonora de Medici and Vincenzo I Gonzaga, 4th Duca di Mantova
2 CONT
