2 CONT *[http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=103599869&ref=wvr Find A Grave]
2 CONT *[http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marie_de%27_Medici Wikipedia]
