2 CONT
2 CONT Francesco IV, Duke of Mantua2     Francesco IV Gonzaga, 5th Duca di Mantova was born on 7 May 1586.2 He was the son of Vincenzo I Gonzaga, 4th Duca di Mantova and Eleonora de Medici.1,2 He married Margherita di Savoia, Principessa
2 CONC  di Savoia, daughter of Carlo Emanuele I, Duca di Savoia and Catalina Micaela von Habsburg, in 1608.2 He died on 22 August 1612 at age 26.1
2 CONT      Francesco IV Gonzaga, 5th Duca di Mantova succeeded to the title of 5th Duca di Mantova in 1612.1 Child of Francesco IV Gonzaga, 5th Duca di Mantova and Margherita di Savoia, Principessa di Savoia 1.Maria Gonzaga, Principessa
