2 CONT     * Bone, Quinton. (1972) Henrietta Maria: Queen of the Cavaliers. Chicago: University of Illinois Press.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Fritze, Ronald H. and William B. Robison. (eds) (1996) Historical dictionary of Stuart England, 1603-1689. Westport: Greenwood Press.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Griffey, Erin. (2008) "Introduction" in Griffey (ed) 2008.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Griffey, Erin. (2008) Henrietta Maria: piety, politics and patronage. Aldershot: Ashgate Publishing.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Hibbard, Caroline. (2008) "'By Our Direction and For Our Use:' The Queen's Patronage of Artists and Artisans seen through her Household Accounts." in Griffey (ed) 2008.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Kitson, Frank. (1999) Prince Rupert: Admiral and General-at-Sea. London: Constable.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Maclagan, Michael Maclagan and Jiří Louda. (1999) Line of Succession: Heraldry of the Royal Families of Europe. London: Little, Brown & Co. ISBN 0-85605-469-1.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Purkiss, Diane. (2007) The English Civil War: A People's History. London: Harper.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Raatschan, Gudrun. (2008) "Merely Ornamental? Van Dyck's portraits of Henrietta Maria." in Griffey (ed) 2008.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Smuts, Malcolm. (2008) "Religion, Politics and Henrietta Maria's Circle, 1625-41" in Griffey (ed) 2008.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Spencer, Charles. (2007) Prince Rupert: The Last Cavalier. London: Phoenix. ISBN 978-0-297-84610-9
2 CONT
