2 CONT
2 CONT     * Wedgwood, C. V. (1966) The King's Peace: 1637-1641. London: C. Nicholls.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Wedgwood, C. V. (1970) The King's War: 1641–1647. London: Fontana.
2 CONT
