2 CONT from Familysearch Pedigree file: ONMF. (rev ed, 1992). Fray Angelico Chavez. p. 252. Matias Pacheco and FELIPE PACHECO, perhaps brothers, were relatives of Josefa Pacheco, very likely her nephews, who were living with her and her 
2 CONC second husband, Juan de Tafoya, in 1706-7. Matias was 20 years old at this time, when he deposed that he did not know who his parents were. He later married Maria Cisneros and was dead by 1728 when their daughter Teodora married J
2 CONC uan Antonio Cabrera. Antother daughter, Valentina, was the wife of Jose Gonzalez, and a niece of Maria Griego.  !ONMF (rev ed). p. 253. FELIPE PACHECO, mentioned with Matias, was a Sargento by 1731 and livin at or near San Juan Pu
2 CONC eblo. His wfie was Rosa Martin. Some of their childre were: Juan Jose, who married Ynez Martin, May 9, 1732; Isabel, md to Francisco Xavier Sanchez, Aug 20, 1743; Jose Antonio, b. Feb 2, 1727; Salvador Vicente, Apr 19, 1729; Diego
2 CONC  Antonio, Nov 19, 1730, and Cayetano, Feb. 18, 1732.  !ONMF (rev ed, 1992), p. 382. FELIPE PACHECO (NMF, p. 253) was a son of Juan Perez Pacheco and Antonia de Arratia (same section), both of whom were dead when Felipe married Ant
2 CONC onia de Leyva, Jan 16, 1702 (DM, 1701, no. 6). Hence Felipe and perhaps Matias Pacheco aslo, was a brother of Josefa Pacheco in that same section. Felipe was a sergeant and 35 years old in 1709, when he took a second wife, Rosa Ma
2 CONC rtin of Santa Cruz. (DM, 1709, no.16). --------------------------------------------- Info from Anna & Ben Gates, 3/13/2001, <bags1946@hotmail.com> from book by Ida Quintana Foraci in Trinidad (CO) public library. Dear Gloria, I'm 
2 CONC sorry it took me so long to respond . I've been busy doing cakes for customers. Its just a hobby but I keep pretty steady work. Sometimes I have to put research on the back burner. It was so nice to meet you and your sister in chu
2 CONC rch on Sunday. We do know your dad pretty well. I hope he is feeling much better. Here is the information I found after I put our data together: Our public library has a collection of books written by Ida Quintana Foraci. Some of 
2 CONC it is pretty accurate and some has a few discrepancies. ---Here is some excerpts from Ida's stories. Miguel Gonzales ,whom I (Ida)believe to be the son of Diego Gonzales and Elena Montes Vigil(p.582)Quintana Books. On 6-12-1767 he
2 CONC  married Maria Candelaria Pacheco. I(Ida) found two children---Santa Cruz Records. 1)Phelipe Santiago Gonzales was baptized 1-30-1768, Padrinos were Blas Trujillo and Maria Ignacia Trujillo.He married Maria Francisca Chacon (p.108
2 CONC 8-b) 2)Maria Rosalia Gonzales was baptized 10-5-1769,Padrinos Ygnacio Mestas and Maria Varela. In 1796 she became the second wife of Antonio Silvestre Lopez .Son of Gregorio Lopez and Juana Romero(p.1088-d) See marriage records p.
2 CONC 818-b2 In Family Search.Com I (anna) found the following record. Miguel Gonzales sex:M Events:Birth 1745,Santa Cruz, Sante Fe, NM Parents:Diego Gonzales and Elena Montes Vigil Film #1985300 Diego Gonzales Sex:M Marriage:Spouse,Ele
2 CONC na Montes Vigil about 1731 Santa Cruz,Santa FE NM Film#1761175 QUINTANA BOOKS Page 582 ELENA MONTES VIGIL----Her husband was Diego Gonzales born 1705 and died 12-1-1745 at Santa Cruz,the son of Diego Gonzales and Maria de Benavide
2 CONC z P.415-b)Santa Cruz Baptisms 1)Maria Ignacia Gonzales born 1734 was the second wife of Juan Antonio Duran 8-81734, Ignacia ,daughter of Diego Gonzales and Elena Vigil, sponsors:Joseph Romero and Ana Maria Herrera. 2)6-8-1743,Fran
2 CONC cisco Gonzales, son of Diego Gonzales and Elena Vigil,sponsor Nicholas Sisneros 3)10-3-1745 Miguel, son of Diego Gonzales and Elena Vigil, sponsors, Pedro Griego and Ana De Herrera. ________________________________________________
2 CONC _________ CANDELARIA PACHECO----Quintana Books --Ygnacio Pacheco was born around 1714 in Santa Cruz, the son of Felipe Pacheco and Antonia Leyva. His wife was Maria Margarita Martin born around 1722 in Santa Cruz. They were marrie
2 CONC d 5-30-1739 --Felipe Pacheco b.1684 son of Juan Jose Perez Pacheco and Antonia de Arratia. On 1-16-1702 he married Antonia Leyva daughter of Pedro de Leyva and Maria Sedillo de Nava. --Juan Jose Perez Pacheco born in 1642 son of G
2 CONC eronimo Pacheco and Francisca Cadimo--- --Antonia de Arratia daughter of Francisco de Arratia. Franciscos parents are Gaspar de Arratia and Maria de Los Angeles Martin. So it looks like this for Candelaria Pacheco line. --Candelar
2 CONC ia Pacheco m. Miguel Gonzales son of Diego Gonzales and Elena Vigil --Ygnacio Pacheco md. Maria Margarita Martin whose parents unknown --Felipe Pacheco md, Antonia Leyva d.o. Pedro Leyva and Maria Sedillo de Nava --Juan Jose Perez
2 CONC  Pacheco md. Francisca Cadimo. I haven't researched her yet. I hope you and I can agree that Miguel's parents are right. Answer Soon Anna Marie Gates ,prima --------------------- Journal of the National Society of Hispanic Genealo
2 CONC gy (NSHG), Raices y Ramas, Vol. 3, No. 2, Summer 2001, pp. 4-19, article "Maria Rosa Griego, A Hispanic Historical Figure" and "Ancestors of Rosalia (Maria Rosa) Griego", by Benceslado Lopez <bencesLopez@msn.com>. p.17. This artic
2 CONC le lists his birth year as "ca 1682" and Gates indicated above that it was "ca 1684". Quote from above article, p. 17. "Felipe Pacheco, born ca 1682, in San Juan, Rio Arriba, NM, died Sep 26, 1739, San Juan, Rio Arriba, NM,, m (1)
2 CONC  Rosa Martin Serrano, born ca 1698 in San Juan, died after 1765 in Nuestra Senora de la Soledad, NM, and married (2) Antonia de leyva Jan 16, 1701/1702, in Santa Fe, NM , born ca 1682, died ca 1716 in Santa Fe, NM" Show Less CITIN
2 CONC G THIS RECORD
2 CONT
