1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wikipedia: [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diego_de_Benavides,_8th_Count_of_Santisteban English], [http://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diego_IV_de_Benavides_y_de_la_Cueva Español]
2 CONT
2 CONT Don Diego de Benavides de La Cueva y Bazán, 1st Marquis of Solera and 8th Count of Santisteban del Puerto (sometimes Don Diego Benavides y de la Cueva, conde de Santisteban del Puerto) (1607, Santisteban del Puerto, Jaén, Spain—ca
2 CONC . March 19, 1666, Lima, Peru), was a Spanish military officer, diplomat, writer and colonial administrator. From December 31, 1661 to March 16, 1666 he was viceroy of Peru.
2 CONT
