2 CONT * [http://es.fundacionmedinaceli.org/casaducal/fichaindividuo.aspx?id=219 '''es.fundacionmedinaceli.org''']
2 CONT ====English Translation====
2 CONT * Antonio de Benavides y de la Cueva, II Duke of Santisteban del Puerto and X Count of Castellar
2 CONT * Birth: Madrid, September 11, 1714
2 CONT * Baptism: St. Peter's Real, September 12, 1714
2 CONT * Death: April 8, 1782
2 CONT ===parents===
2 CONT * Manuel de Benavides and Aragon, Duke of Santisteban del Puerto, [Palermo, 06/01/1683 - Madrid, 11/10/1748]
2 CONT * Catalina Ana de la Cueva and Arias de Saavedra, countess of Castellar IX, [Madrid, 25/03/1684 - 07/07/1752]
2 CONT ===Spouses and Children===
2 CONT A. - Church of San Pedro Real (Madrid), 08/05/1735
2 CONT ====married first====
2 CONT * 1 - '''Anne Catherine of Toledo''', [? - Royal Site of Aranjuez, 01/07/1742]
2 CONT ====married second====
2 CONT B. - Church of San Martín (Madrid), 28/10/1744
2 CONT * 2 '''Maria Pacheco of Porter Tellez-Giron''', Puebla de Montalbán, c. 26/01/1731 - Madrid, 14/11/1754]
2 CONT ># Joaquina Mary, III Duchess of Santisteban del Puerto (1746 - 1805), [Church of San Pedro Real (Madrid), 06/02/1764], married - Luis Maria Fernandez de Cordoba and Gonzaga, Duke of Medina Celi XIII (1749 - 1806) 
2 CONT >#  Mary of the Porter (1748 -?), married - Cristobal de Zayas Moscoso and Mendoza, Marquis of Cullera III (? -?)
2 CONT ># Ana Maria (1754 - 1765)
2 CONT ># Joaquin Maria (1751 - 1752)
2 CONT ># Joaquina Mary (1752 - 1765)
2 CONT ># Maria de la Soledad (? - 1749)
2 CONT ====married third====
2 CONT C - Church of San Sebastián (Madrid), 27/05/1755, 
2 CONT * 3 - '''Ana Maria de la O Fernandez de Cordoba and Moncada''', [Madrid, 17/12/1738 - 08/04/1782]
2 CONT ># Francisca de Paula (1763 - 1827), [Madrid, 17/07/1780]. married -  Diego Tellez-Giron Pacheco Gómez de Sandoval, Duke of Frias XIII and VI Cilleruelo Marquis (1754 - 1811)
2 CONT ># Josefa Joaquina (1773 -?)
