2 CONC pr 1589\nd. 25 Jun 1655|p11367.htm#i113662|Vincenzo I. Gonzaga, 4th Duca di Mantova|b. 21 Sep 1562\nd. 9 Feb 1612|p11205.htm#i112050|Eleonora de Medici|b. 28 Feb 1567\nd. 19 Sep 1611|p22026.htm#i220251|Carlo E. I., Duca di Savoia|
