2 CONT Claude de Lorraine (1612-1648) was a daughter of Henry II, Duke of Lorraine and Margerita Gonzaga, her sister was Nicolette of Lorraine.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married her cousin Nicholas II, Duke of Lorraine and had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Philip Ferdinand (1639-1659)
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles V (1643-1690), Duke of Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Eleanor (1645-1646)
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Maria, died young
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Maria Theresa (1648-1661), abbess of Remiremont.
2 CONT --------------------
