2 CONT ===Violante Margherita di Savoia (1)
2 CONT *F, #114446, b. 15 November 1635, d. 29 April 1663
2 CONT *Last Edited=9 Mar 2007
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=1.84%
2 CONT
2 CONT Violante Margherita di Savoia was born on 15 November 1635. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Vittorio Amadeo I, Duca di Savoia and Marie Christine de Bourbon, Princesse de France. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Rainuzzio II Farnese, Duca di Parma, son of Odoardo Farnese, Duca di Parma and Margherita de Medici, in 1660. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 29 April 1663 at age 27.
2 CONT
