2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.4%
2 CONT
2 CONT Rainuzzio II Farnese, Duca di Parma was born on 17 September 1630. (2) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Odoardo Farnese, Duca di Parma and Margherita de Medici. (3), (2) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, firstly, Violante Margherita di Savoia, daughter of Vittorio Amadeo I, Duca di Savoia and Marie Christine de Bourbon, Princesse de France, in 1660. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Isabella d'Este, Principessa di Modena, daughter of Francesco I d'Este, Duca di Modena and Mary Farnese, on 18 February 1664. (4) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, thirdly, Maria d'Este, Principessa di Modena, daughter of Francesco I d'Este, Duca di Modena and Mary Farnese, on 1 October 1668. (4) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 11 December 1694 at age 64. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Rainuzzio II Farnese, Duca di Parma succeeded to the title of Duca di Parma in 1646. (1), (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Rainuzzio II Farnese, Duca di Parma and Isabella d'Este, Principessa di Modena
