2 CONT
2 CONT Capt. Tomas Tadeo SANCHEZ [612] 
2 CONT *was born about 1709. 
2 CONT *He was baptized on 4 June 1709 in Valle del Carrizal, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.[1490] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Capt. Tomas Tadeo Sanchez had lived at a ranch called San Matias, near Valle del Carrizal, Nuevo Leon, New Spain. He became the founder of present day Laredo, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Tomas SANCHEZ and Josepha DE LA GARZA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Catarina de ERIBE (Uribe). Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Tomas SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT *2. Maria Josepha SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT *3. Joseph Eugenio SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT *4. Blas de Jesus SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT *5. Maria Gertrudis SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT *6. Joseph Santiago SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT *7. Maria Alejandra SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT *8. Tomasa SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT *9. Dionicio SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT *10. Tomas Antonio SANCHEZ, 
2 CONT *11. Santiago de Jesus SANCHEZ. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b206.html#P1116
2 CONT
2 CONT ===================================
2 CONT
2 CONT Capt. Tomas Sanchez M
2 CONT
2 CONT Note* 
2 CONT Capt. Tomas Sanchez was the founder of Laredo, Texas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family  Child
2 CONT * Alejandra Sanchez+
