2 CONT Alejandra Sanchez F
2 CONT *  Father Capt. Tomas Sanchez
2 CONT
2 CONT Alejandra Sanchez was the daughter of Capt. Tomas Sanchez. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT *Alejandra Sanchez married Jose Fernando Vidaurri, son of Juan Antonio Vidaurri and Manuela Borrego. 
2 CONT
