2 CONT *She married CAPTAIN JUAN RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR-DE-LA-GARZA 1695, 
2 CONT **son of DIEGO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA-INES DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO. He was born 29 Nov 1668 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
