1 CONT Walter, the Dutchesses of Cleveland and Portsmith, and Nell Gwyn, and many
1 CONT illegitimate children, most of whom he acknowledged and enobled. Then, the
1 CONT Duke of York, Charles' brother,  succeeded to the throne as James VII/II.
